    "1飜" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1 Han"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "20符から始めて足します。門前でロン +10、ツモ +2、刻子（ポン・暗刻）は明刻 2・暗刻 4（1・9・字牌は倍）、槓は明槓 8・暗槓 16（1・9・字牌は倍）、役牌の雀頭 +2（自風と場風が同じ連風牌は +4）、嵌張・辺張・単騎待ち +2。最後に10符単位へ切り上げます。七対子は25符固定、平和はツモ20符・ロン30符です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start at 20 fu and add: concealed ron +10, tsumo +2, triplets (pon / concealed) open 2 / concealed 4 (doubled for terminals and honors), kans open 8 / concealed 16 (doubled for terminals and honors), yakuhai pair +2 (+4 when seat wind and round wind are the same), closed / edge / pair wait +2. Round up to the next 10 fu. Seven Pairs is fixed at 25 fu; Pinfu is 20 fu on tsumo and 30 fu on ron."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "25符は七対子（2飜以上）です。20符は平和のツモだけなので、ロンの表にはありません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "25 fu is Seven Pairs (2 han or more). 20 fu only happens with a Pinfu tsumo, so it isn't in the ron table."
          }
        }
      }
    },
