    "「門前のみ」はポン・チー・大明槓をすると消える役です（暗槓は門前のままなので消えません）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Closed only\" yaku are lost if you call Pon, Chii or an open Kan (a closed Kan keeps your hand closed)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「鳴きN飜」はポン・チー・大明槓をすると飜数が下がる役、「門前のみ」は消える役です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Open: N\" yaku are worth fewer Han if you call Pon, Chii or an open Kan. \"Closed only\" yaku are lost."
