    },
    "北" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "N"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "南" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "S"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ 2 枚" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pair"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ 3 枚" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ牌3枚（刻子）か連番3枚（順子）を4組と、同じ牌2枚（雀頭）を1組そろえると和了です。ほかに七対子（対子7組）と国士無双もあります" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Win with four sets (three of a kind or three in a row) plus a pair. Chiitoitsu (seven pairs) and Kokushi Musou also win"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ牌4枚でカンできます。手の内の4枚なら暗槓、他の人の捨て牌でそろえば明槓、ポン済みの牌に4枚目を足せば加槓です。カンすると新しいドラがめくれ、王牌から1枚（嶺上牌）を引きます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Four of a kind makes a Kan: a closed Kan from your own hand, an open Kan on a discard, or an added Kan onto a Pon. Each Kan reveals a new dora and you draw a replacement tile from the dead wall"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ牌が2枚あれば誰の捨て牌でもポン、連番であと2枚そろうときは上家（左の人）の捨て牌をチーできます。鳴くとその牌を含む面子を手牌の外に晒し、そのまま自分の番になって1枚切ります" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With two matching tiles you can Pon anyone's discard. To complete a sequence you can Chii the discard of the player on your left. The called set is placed face up and you then discard a tile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ種類の数牌で123・456・789をそろえる" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "123, 456 and 789 in the same suit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "和了した手: %1$@、和了牌は %2$@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Winning hand: %1$@. Winning tile: %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "和了の形" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
